  m_Text: 'You can control your tank by interacting with several elements, using
    SPACE or the A button.


    Hold SPACE or A on either lever on the left and
    right walls to control it''s respective tread throttle with W/S or your left
    analog stick.


    Aim the turret by interacting with the centre console in
    the same way.


    Load the gun by interacting with the ammo pile at the back,
    and fire it by interacting with the loader at the front.


    Larger enemies
    can only be killed when shot with a shell loaded by the player of the corresponding
    colour!'
